|               |     TableScan: lineitem projection=[l_extendedprice, l_discount], full_filters=[lineitem.l_shipdate >= CAST(Utf8("1994-01-01") AS Date32), lineitem.l_shipdate < CAST(Utf8("1995-01-01") AS Date32), lineitem.l_discount BETWEEN Float64(0.05) AND Float64(0.07), lineitem.l_quantity < Int64(24)]                                                                                                                                                     |
